NOTICE — Gentle Companion

This repository vendors two crates from Bellterm (https://github.com/nimrc/bellterm,
Apache-2.0), which in turn vendors them from the Herdr project:

  - crates/herdr-protocol  (Apache-2.0)
  - crates/herdr-client    (Apache-2.0)

Both crates are Apache-2.0 licensed; their LICENSE-APACHE files are vendored
alongside the source, together with their READMEs and the upstream NOTICE.md.

WIRE CONTRACT WARNING: the bincode field order of the structs in
herdr-protocol/src/wire.rs (and related wire files) and the order of the enum
variants across the protocol crates are a wire contract. They are serialized
positionally by bincode and MUST NOT be reordered, renamed by serde attribute
tricks, added to, or removed from, or the client will silently desync from the
Herdr endpoint protocol (generation 1, protocol: 22).

Do not modify the vendored protocol logic to make things compile or connect.
